CabinetOS 2P Start @PROJECT_VERSION@: the licences of everything it carries

Each folder here is one line of Settings, About, Credits and licenses, and holds that part's own
licence text.

GStreamer, GLib and proxy-libintl are under the LGPL. They are GStreamer's own builds, version
@GST_VERSION_TEXT@, from gstreamer.freedesktop.org, carried unchanged as separate libraries beside the
app, so any of them can be swapped for another build. Their source, and the recipes they were built
with, are at:

    https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/src/
    https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/cerbero

2P Start's own source is at https://github.com/MMagTech/cabinet-linkup-guest
